{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"prospecting_hammer","model_identifier":"prospecting_hammer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## prospecting_hammer\n\nWorker tool.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.0..1.0, y -4.0..5.5, z -11.8..2.5 (size 2.0 x 9.5 x 14.2 u = 6 x 27 x 40 cm).\nProspecting hammer (refined-iron default; iron grade textures), about 35 cm (14 u): small square striking face down (-Y), pointed back (+Y) for splitting rock, leather-wrapped grip. Grip at the origin, head 10-12 u forward (-Z). One-handed; used for the Prospect job.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `prospecting_hammer_iron_bloom.png`, `prospecting_hammer_iron_wrought.png`, `prospecting_hammer_iron_refined.png`\n"},"description":"## prospecting_hammer\n\nWorker tool.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.0..1.0, y -4.0..5.5, z -11.8..2.5 (size 2.0 x 9.5 x 14.2 u = 6 x 27 x 40 cm).\nProspecting hammer (refined-iron default; iron grade textures), about 35 cm (14 u): small square striking face down (-Y), pointed back (+Y) for splitting rock, leather-wrapped grip. Grip at the origin, head 10-12 u forward (-Z). One-handed; used for the Prospect job.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `prospecting_hammer_iron_bloom.png`, `prospecting_hammer_iron_wrought.png`, `prospecting_hammer_iron_refined.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"handle","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-0.6,-10.0],"to":[0.5,0.6,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inf